<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <% if refresh %><meta http-equiv="refresh" content="<%= refresh %>"><% end %>
    <title>Simulador do cliente · canais simulados</title>
    <style>
      :root { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; color: #1f2933; background: #f5f7fa; }
      body { margin: 0; }
      header { background: #102a43; color: #fff; padding: .75rem 1.5rem; }
      main { max-width: 64rem; margin: 1.5rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; }
      .card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec; border-radius: .5rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; }
      label { display: block; font-size: .85rem; margin: .5rem 0 .2rem; color: #486581; }
      input, select, textarea { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: .45rem; font: inherit; border: 1px solid #bcccdc; border-radius: .3rem; }
      label.inline { display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; margin-top: .75rem; }
      label.inline input { width: auto; }
      .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 1rem; }
      button { margin-top: .75rem; padding: .5rem 1rem; font: inherit; border: 0; border-radius: .3rem; background: #2680c2; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
      button.secondary { background: #829ab1; margin: 0; padding: .3rem .6rem; font-size: .85rem; }
      table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .9rem; }
      th, td { text-align: left; padding: .45rem .4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e7eb; vertical-align: top; }
      code { font-size: .8rem; }
      .muted { color: #829ab1; font-size: .85rem; }
      .badge { display: inline-block; padding: .1rem .5rem; border-radius: 1rem; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600; }
      .badge--ok { background: #e3f9e5; color: #207227; }
      .badge--dup { background: #fff3c4; color: #8d2b0b; }
      .badge--err { background: #ffe3e3; color: #a61b1b; }
      ul.replies { list-style: none; margin: .5rem 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: .4rem; }
      li.reply { border-left: 3px solid #2680c2; background: #f0f4f8; padding: .4rem .6rem; border-radius: .3rem; }
      li.reply form { display: inline; }
      .total { font-weight: 600; color: #102a43; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header><strong>Canais simulados</strong> · faz o papel dos provedores (ADR-012). O histórico fica só em memória.</header>
    <main><%== yield %></main>
  </body>
</html>
